<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/10/eng@/~cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 25(1) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “in accordance with regulations made by the Minister” the words “in any manner as may be determined by the Minister”. Amendment of section 46b"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/10/eng@> .
