<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/10/eng@/~cl_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 46b of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsection: “(3 a) A member of a Parole Board shall be paid such allowances according to such rates as may be determined by the Minister after consultation with the Minister of Finance.”. New Part IVaa"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/10/eng@> .
